{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52722","headline":"丹元子步天歌 东方七宿 四 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 东方七宿 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"房，四星直下主明堂。\n键闭一黄斜向上，钩铃两个近其傍。\n罸有三星植键上，两咸夹罸似房状。\n房下一星号爲日，从官两个日下出。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}